rule4_end

 rem rule 5: When Knight touches Shadow: take 1 from Lives, send every Knight back to start, protect
 rem   every Knight for 1.5 seconds and play Crash.
rule5
 oi = 0
 if otype[oi] <> T_KNIGHT then goto rule5_ni
 if oprot[oi] then goto rule5_ni
 x1 = ox[oi] : y1 = oy[oi]
 oj = 1
 if otype[oj] <> T_SHADOW then goto rule5_nj_5
 if oprot[oj] then goto rule5_nj_5
 x2 = ox[oj] : y2 = oy[oj]
 if boxcollision(x1, y1, 8, 14, x2, y2, 8, 12) then gosub rule5_do
